WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:02,160
What's going on

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,040
If you have something to say, explain it clearly

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:04,960
Don't use force

4
00:00:05,240 --> 00:00:07,960
How dare she hit on Wu Ga's girlfriend

5
00:00:07,960 --> 00:00:09,320
Today I want to drive her away

6
00:00:09,320 --> 00:00:10,520
My surname is not Han

7
00:00:10,520 --> 00:00:12,440
Who hooked up with your girlfriend?

8
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:14,840
It was obviously her who came to me on her own

9
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:18,840
How dare you say that my girlfriend is looking for death instead of fighting?

10
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:21,480
These people are really busy with their time.

11
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,960
Just because a woman started such a big fight

12
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:25,800
If you are mentally ill, go away

13
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:27,800
This is something between us and let it go

14
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:31,730
Fuck you

15
00:00:32,130 --> 00:00:37,980
Is that enough?

16
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:40,020
Now I ask her to apologize to you

17
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:41,740
Your wine bottle was also smashed

18
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:43,260
Although it was not her but me who was hit

19
00:00:43,260 --> 00:00:44,620
But I'm not going to argue with you

20
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:47,430
You asked her to apologize for my sake.

21
00:00:47,430 --> 00:00:49,430
How about just taking over this matter?

22
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:50,880
I promise

23
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:54,140
She needs to apologize to my girlfriend. Where are you?

24
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:57,700
I blocked it for you just now

25
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:59,760
I have blocked the disaster for you

26
00:00:59,760 --> 00:01:02,760
It is indeed the disaster caused by your own irresponsible words.
